.TH GO-FOR-IT-QT 1 "November 2026" "go-for-it-qt 2.0.2" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
go-for-it-qt \- productivity to-do list with built-in Pomodoro timer (Qt 6 GUI)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B go-for-it-qt
[\fIOPTIONS\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
\fBGo for It Qt\fR is a modern productivity application combining a task list with a built-in Pomodoro timer, SQLite storage, and issue tracker synchronization.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-tui\fR
Launch terminal UI (TUI) frontend instead of Qt Quick GUI.
.TP
\fB\-\-db\fR \fIPATH\fR
Path to custom SQLite database file.
.TP
\fB\-\-list\fR
Print available task lists to stdout and exit.
.TP
\fB\-\-load\fR \fILIST_ID\fR
Open directly into specified list ID or name.
.TP
\fB\-\-logfile\fR \fIPATH\fR
Write application debug and activity log to specified file.
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Display command-line help and exit.
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Display version information and exit.
